</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER>Squire/Cavalier Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

File updated March, 2006. 


You watch the training exercises for a while, and see what this place 
has to offer.


Name: Squire
Command: squire
Creators: Elwood and Shinarae
Maximum level: 15


Description:
Classically, squires are young warriors serving a knight or similar master in
exchange for training. While under the expert instructions of a seasoned
fighter, they learn skills related to combat, adventuring, exploring, and any
other suitable skills the master knows. Only by graduating from ones
apprenticeship as a squire can you proceed into more challenging guilds that
require combat expertise both on foot and on horseback. However, some may find
the general purpose knowledge offered to squires reward enough in itself.
  

Joining requirements:
 Background must be nomad or civilized (passed)
Abilities gained when joining:
 You are now a member of the guild of squires.
 You receive a brush as a symbol of your duties.
 May train skill Attack to 24%
 May train skill Push to 28%
 May train skill Polearms to 19%
 May train skill Consider to 38%
 May train skill Tinning to 19%
 May train skill Torch creation to 14%
 May train skill Hiking to 19%
 May train skill Fire building to 19%
 May train skill Evaluate mount to 9%


